  "Eras cut at events multiple reviews attest: E1 15 Dec 2021 → 28 Sep 2022, 114, mean 3.921, 1–2★ 21.9% (launch and first-year shakeout); E2 16 Oct 2022 → 11 Sep 2023, 68, 4.235, 11.8% (mature free tier); E3 4 Oct 2023 → 29 Dec 2024, 167, 4.162, 13.2% (widgets paywalled); E4 3 Jan → 15 Nov 2025, 83, 4.205, 15.7% (stable year); E5 1 Dec 2025 → 4 Sep 2026, 108, 3.722, 25.0% (capped at 2, then 1); a trend is claimed only if it holds in both era and half-year tables; E3 long because no attested event splits it",
